<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-04T15:37:13.678Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:37:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to abduct civilians and kill worshippers across northern Nigeria, with gunmen abducting six mourners on a Benue highway and releasing them after a N2.5 million ransom, while a pastor and three others were shot dead in a Benue community. In Kaduna, bandits seized 18 people in a fresh attack and killed two, abducting 21 others, and a market in the Logo Local Government Area of Benue State saw four people killed and five injured. Fulani bandits also abducted a man during an attack on two colleagues in Bassa, Plateau. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxObXV6MGtFZkFOYzgzZElZalBkdzQyeVg2cmcwLWRURmZLTEhsZ0J1dWpvQzE5eFVFZ05qN2M4SktHR3diYnN4Wk1HQlVheS1LN1NUNDIxcWY1R1lBX1pJUHVuVE4tdUc3bUtyWXB6WXRZdldudkNsTDVDVU9qOXRybkNxQ2dvVGlfVTNWN2tIdl8wemMyQUxhTlc4aFZnWGdXYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPbVdCRExkOG83LW1SV0hrNkdDUThHV2d6YzdTYUNvUElZR2dISXMtU09QNFp4OGZWY2Q2cjVIVFBrWGtFSUlaM1VPcmNDbmdjangwNEJvVU8tX3p5OHBuZzVGVjhLVEJrQ3lCamhsMDZncV94dDkyNHJ6QUhDaW9iOGRkRFF1NElKTDhVVVdHekVFc1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eagle Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9RTlo4aU1uc2FhY3RpQWtIOGMtOWxucnRwTkRJZUVpZnFNNS1EOS1CeHZLeFFwSzA3ZTJlRHgxSEZ0UXpPM0VhVUdXY2xualFwYWFOS2ttTGZrNzB3NElxZkZnTXUwUEVyT2RlbV9UZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Blueprint Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOM0FaZWtac2NqbDc2ZlB0d09qcVJ3XzJ4Wk02YVFNaE1lMk5iMXlJWjVnc2x6bXFJaE56SFlCTkRTdkNYUk5UTUEyTUxwYnRhaFFwSDBpeEd2NDBWUnJpUExyNjFqaC1RYXhZSUlSZmZmNnZpSFZPS2NUdjFuRVlnVTZ0dWlla21lN2w2NFBXcUJPNnY2N3owcmtwM1BqQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eagle Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: